<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia seeks 100,000 tonnes feed barley - trade.</title>
<headline>Tunisia seeks 100,000 tonnes feed barley - trade.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia has launched a tender for Thursday to purchase four lots or more of 25,000 tonnes of feed barley each, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Shipment dates are as follows: 25,000 tonnes, 10-20 May 1997, 25,000 tonnes 10-20 June, 25,000 tonnes 10-20 July and 25,000 tonnes 10-20 August.</p>
<p>Tunis newsroom, 216-1-787538</p>
